  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Al Qaws 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Al Qaws for Sexual &amp; Gender Diversity in Palestinian Society is a grassroots organization committed to strategically working to expand access to living possibilities for LGBT and queer people. Al Qaws is recognized by civil institutions and the public as the most relevant and reliable source on LGBTQ+ issues in Palestinian society in both West Bank and 48. 

Facing a recent crisis, Al Qaws underscores the urgency of sustaining its programs, which collectively contribute to preserving LGBTQ+ history, providing support networks, and fostering a new societal understanding of LGBTQ+ rights in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
